Analog Canvas VACASK analytical divider qualification

ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model resistance resistor
model voltage vsource

V1 (input 0) voltage dc=3
R1 (input output) resistance r=1k
R2 (output 0) resistance r=2k

control
  abort always
  options rawfile="ascii" strictsave=2 reltol=1e-8 vntol=1e-10
  save default
  analysis divider_op op
  sweep supply instance="V1" parameter="dc" from=0 to=3 step=0.5
    analysis divider_dc op
endc
